 "words": 237,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Seven miles from Jerusalem the evening shadows grow",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Two friends are walking slowly with their faces hanging low",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A stranger joins them on the road and asks them why they grieve",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We had hoped he was the one, they say, now what can we believe",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 1.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Were not our hearts burning within us",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While he talked with us on the road",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And opened the Scriptures to us",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stay with us, for it is nearly evening",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The day is almost over",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Beginning there with Moses and the prophets one by one",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He showed them in the Scriptures all that spoke of God's own Son",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "How the Christ would have to suffer, then enter in his glory",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And mile by mile the stranger walked them through the ancient story",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Were not our hearts burning within us",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While he talked with us on the road",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And opened the Scriptures to us",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stay with us, for it is nearly evening",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The day is almost over",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He took the bread, blessed it, broke it",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then their eyes were opened and they recognized him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They got up that very hour and returned to Jerusalem",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord has risen and has appeared to Simon",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He was made known to them in the breaking of the bread",
